      "file": "content/batch-001/sources/aspca-dog-separation-anxiety.html",
      "excerpt": "Escape attempts by dogs with separation anxiety are often extreme"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "knowledge-073",
    "contentType": "knowledge",
    "title": "作息突然变化，也会影响狗的独处感受",
    "text": "从经常有人在家变成需要独处更久，或经历搬家、家庭成员离开，可能与分离焦虑的出现有关。如果狗在生活安排变化后开始表现不安，把变化发生的时间也记下来，有助于专业人员理解情况。重点是观察它如何应对新的节奏，而不是把突然出现的困扰简单解释成任性或故意捣乱。",
    "topics": [
      "养宠经验"
    ],
    "circleId": "circle-walks",
    "editorId": "catalog-dog-life",
    "source": {
      "title": "Separation Anxiety",
      "publisher": "ASPCA",
      "url": "https://www.aspca.org/pet-care/dog-care/common-dog-behavior-issues/separation-anxiety",
      "author": "ASPCA",
      "checkedAt": "2026-09-29"
    },
    "review": {
      "status": "approved",
      "reviewer": "有宠有邻内容整理",
